 "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/942861d2df646d13704ffa16602ce89f.avif?t=1788855385\" width=1200 height=300 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/f6a62391e06ec37b6e64b4220a4abfce.avif?t=1788855385\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seaside Wash</strong> pairs immersive cleaning sounds with a soothing soundtrack to create <strong>a tranquil and engaging experience</strong>. Every job delivers a satisfying sense of progress as rusty, worn ships slowly return to pristine condition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/4c000baca2af45ecd26d4c3ca6c5c6dd.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/8f0c000bef4699ccaf930a6f8a2c6901.avif?t=1788855385\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different surfaces and dirt require different tools. <strong>Pick wisely for maximum efficiency</strong> as each cleaning task demands the right equipment, and approach to achieve the best results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/99ff1adae7d24d65f780ec2173f5055a.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ff9ee511c950e50c818533927a6735ed.avif?t=1788855385\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your efficiency by <strong>upgrading and repairing your tools</strong> to handle tougher and more rewarding jobs. <strong>Unlock better tools and refine your approach</strong> as restoration tasks become more demanding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/fa1c7b2305cbaaec6c2c18c7195a5562.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/03a9607fa6333e80dd56eb59d5439aea.avif?t=1788855385\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work on a <strong>variety of vessels</strong>, from small fishing boats to massive cargo freighters. Each ship features its own structure, scale, and cleaning challenges waiting to be restored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/ad09830208534117340c9443bb33d8ef.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/b235983149a197de5d4221ea0a0cd510.avif?t=1788855385\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean every part of the ship</strong>, from the hull and bow to the mast, deck, and interior spaces. Explore detailed work areas filled with grime, hidden spots, and satisfying restoration opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0ec612c96f3960cf2e7f7791a5d33ac4.avif?t=1788855385\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle layers of <strong>salt</strong>, <strong>rust</strong>, and <strong>stubborn barnacles</strong> that require different cleaning strategies. Learn how each type of grime behaves and choose the best method to remove it effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/bd56949de6d6d41e046607a282e47d57.avif?t=1788855385\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on jobs at your own pace, choosing tasks that fit your tools, your strategy, and your time. <strong>Progress freely through a variety of tasks</strong> while <strong>building your reputation</strong> and <strong>improving your workshop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/b439ceadceaaccb459be1e0c4c3adc6b.avif?t=1788855385\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between jobs, unwind with <strong>relaxing mini games</strong> like <strong>fishing</strong> and <strong>cooking</strong> at your cozy seaside home. Enjoy peaceful seaside moments that offer a refreshing break from your daily restoration work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛥️ Restore a variety of ships across immersive and detailed work environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧰 Use specialized tools and workshop systems to handle challenging restoration tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 Upgrade and expand your workspace through rewarding progression mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 Work across multi-level indoor and outdoor seaside areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌤️ Experience dynamic weather, day–night cycles, and relaxing seaside events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready, and don’t forget to join our Discord to stay updated with the latest news and updates for Seaside Wash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
