tem_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/76215405fcce6f316d3a07192c023b84.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0ec612c96f3960cf2e7f7791a5d33ac4.avif?t=1788855385\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle layers of <strong>salt</strong>, <strong>rust</strong>, and <strong>stubborn barnacles</strong> that require different cleaning strategies. Learn how each type of grime behaves and choose the best method to remove it effectively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/aa48c70b3c44256a6b64fa75a64c2854.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/bd56949de6d6d41e046607a282e47d57.avif?t=1788855385\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on jobs at your own pace, choosing tasks that fit your tools, your strategy, and your time. <strong>Progress freely through a variety of tasks</strong> while <strong>building your reputation</strong> and <strong>improving your workshop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/0fa5de5358827b1ddf79fb6e39f8c787.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/b439ceadceaaccb459be1e0c4c3adc6b.avif?t=1788855385\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between jobs, unwind with <strong>relaxing mini games</strong> like <strong>fishing</strong> and <strong>cooking</strong> at your cozy seaside home. Enjoy peaceful seaside moments that offer a refreshing break from your daily restoration work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.poster.avif?t=1788855385\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.webm?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/1b7077fa63d15f9c70edf42c3d6bc79a.mp4?t=1788855385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛥️ Restore a variety of ships across immersive and detailed work environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧰 Use specialized tools and workshop systems to handle challenging restoration tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 Upgrade and expand your workspace through rewarding progression mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏠 Work across multi-level indoor and outdoor seaside areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌤️ Experience dynamic weather, day–night cycles, and relaxing seaside events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready, and don’t forget to join our Discord to stay updated with the latest news and updates for Seaside Wash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4719020/extras_big/6279eda5043bcdbbbb3b2bc78cc60309.avif?t=1788855385 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
 "short_description": "Seaside Wash is a cozy job simulator where you clean, repair, and restore ships from rust and barnacles to pristine condition. Upgrade tools, grow your business, discover rare finds, build your own ship, and enjoy peaceful seaside activities.",
